593 0 obj
  << /ActualText (OBJECTIVE\nProduct Designer with a strong foundation in user\055centered design and passionate about integrating AI into workflows\056 Pursuing a BA in Global Business and Digital Arts at the University of Waterloo\056\n\nexperience\nMarketing Designer\nKing\031s Pastry\nSept 2025 \055 Dec 2025\054 Mississauga\054 ON\nDesigned wireframes and high\055fidelity desktop and mobile landing pages to support new product launches\nUsed AI tools to assist with front\055end coding and implemented Google Analytics to track performance and user behavior\nConducted competitive analysis and market research to inform design and product decisions\nCollaborated on marketing assets for digital and print campaigns\n\nUX\057UI Design\nSun Life uXperience Design Sprint\nNov 2024\054 Waterloo\054 ON\nCompleted an end\055to\055end UX\057UI design for a mobile budgeting app during a 12\055hour design sprint\nCreated user personas\054 journey maps\054 and low\055to\055high fidelity wireframes using Figma\nDesigned a clean\054 intuitive interface for young Canadian parents\nEarned 3rd place out of 100 students after presenting the final prototype to industry judges\n\neducation\nBA of Arts in Global Business and Digital Arts\nUniversity of Waterloo\n2023 \055 2027\054 Canada)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 594 0 R
     /Pg 588 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
